# Nothing in this folder is committed any more.
#
# The originals were 4K60 at 15-17 MB. The web encodes that ship — 720p and
# 1080p, no audio — live in the R2 bucket instead, and the site fetches them
# from there (see src/lib/assets.ts). Two of them used to be committed, which
# is why the repository still carries roughly 8 MB in its history that nothing
# will ever serve again.
#
# This folder stays as a working directory: encode here, upload to R2 under
# `videos/`, and the site picks the file up by name.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
